J.W.BAXTER                   at 18:25 PDT
          
Waymen:  I agree completely that MacForth is somewhere between 79 and 83. I
quibble over your inclusion of LEAVE in the 79ness side...MacForth Plus was
given the 83 DO LOOP and LEAVE so far as I know.
  Don was violently against the "no-state-smartness" idea in the 83  standards
meetings, only giving in (so I understand...this is all several levels removed
from Don) when it became clear that without the state-smartness elimination,
there would be no standard (it was a "religious" matter).
  Since a 32-bit Forth by definition isn't either 79 OR 83 Standard, it
appears Don decided not to get rid of state-smartness.  I, for one, am glad.
  Note that I can't speak to the relative merits of MacForth and Mach2 (and
haven't).  I've never used Mach2.
  --John
